Malis wants to improve her fitness. Every morning, she jogs in the park for ten minutes. Then she does ten push-ups and twenty sit-ups. She loves the skipping rope! After exercise, she can feel her heartbeat and she is covered in sweat. She drinks water, not an energy drink.

